  "important_notes": [
    "The master layer does not perform a second round of outlier removal; city-level final-model cleaning decisions are preserved.",
    "city is standardized to the city folder/market used for the extraction, while property_city_original preserves the value present in each source CSV.",
    "source_markets records every market file in which a duplicate listing_id appeared.",
    "300 duplicate listing_id rows were found across the 14 input files; 294 were Chandigarh/Mohali overlaps and 6 were Noida/Greater Noida overlaps.",
    "Area basis is preserved because carpet, built-up, super-built-up and super-area measurements are not interchangeable for valuation.",
    "The master dataset is ready for the next validation/standardization phase, but locality normalization and valuation-specific feature engineering have not yet been performed."
  ]
